# Universal Chatbot Framework
## Architecture Proposal v1.0

**Stack:** LangGraph · FastAPI · LiteLLM · LlamaIndex  
**Persistence:** PostgreSQL — LangGraph checkpointer + pgvector store  
**Transport:** SSE · WebSocket · REST

---

